  "solution": "Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Do đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.",
